    "title": "Missing 14-year-old last seen in Somerset found - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Madylin Goins ,\n1 days ago\nSOMERSET, Ky. ( FOX 56 ) — The 14-year-old who was reported missing in Somerset has been found.\nBieber Salvador, 14, was last seen around noon on Monday, April 6, in the Royal Way area of Somerset.\n🔎 MISSING IN KENTUCKY Authorities described Salvador as approximately 5’6″ 125 pounds, with brown eyes and short brown hair. He was last seen wearing a gray sweater, blue jeans, and dark green Crocs.\nHe may be in the downtown area near Rocky Hollow Park, the Somerset Police Department wrote.\nLATEST KENTUCKY NEWS: If you see anyone matching this description or have information on his whereabouts, contact the Pulaski County 911 Center by dialing 911, or call 606-678-5008.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to FOX 56 News.",
    "summary": "Bieber Salvador, 14, was last seen around noon on Monday, April 6, in the Royal Way area of Somerset. He was last seen wearing a gray sweater, blue jeans, and dark green Crocs. He may be in the downtown area near Rocky Hollow Park, the Somerset Police Department wrote. LATEST KENTUCKY NEWS: If you see anyone matching this description or have information on his whereabouts, contact the Pulaski County 911 Center by dialing 911, or call 606-678-5008. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.",
